#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:7
msgid "Color selection"
msgstr "颜色选择"

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:10
msgid "Basic color"
msgstr "基本颜色"

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:12
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides a **Select color** PopUp window with some basic "
"colors."
msgstr "QElectroTech 提供了一个带有若干基本颜色的 **选择颜色** 弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:16
msgid "To select a color:"
msgstr "选择颜色的方法："

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:18
msgid "Click on the desired color."
msgstr "点击所需的颜色。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:19
msgid "Press **Select** button."
msgstr "按下 **选择** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:21
msgid ""
"The **Select color** PopUp window is also provided with a custom section "
"where the colors defined in the past are stored."
msgstr "**选择颜色** 弹出窗口还提供自定义区域，用于保存之前定义的颜色。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:24
msgid "Custom color"
msgstr "自定义颜色"

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:26
msgid "QElectroTech allows customizing colors by defining the HTML code."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许通过定义 HTML 代码来自定义颜色。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:28
msgid "To define a custom color:"
msgstr "定义自定义颜色的方法："

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:30
msgid ""
"Press the button + from the custom color section of the **Select color** "
"PopUp window."
msgstr "在 **选择颜色** 弹出窗口的自定义颜色区域中按下 + 按钮。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:31
msgid "Define the HTML code of the desired color in the text box."
msgstr "在文本框中定义所需颜色的 HTML 代码。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:36
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech custom color selection window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 自定义颜色选择窗口"

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:38
msgid ""
"Press **Select** button to add the new color to the custom section of the  "
"**Select color** PopUp window."
msgstr "按下 **选择** 按钮，将新颜色添加到 **选择颜色** 弹出窗口的自定义区域中。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:42
msgid "The custom color can also be defined visually:"
msgstr "自定义颜色也可以通过可视化方式定义："

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:44
msgid "The color scale can be defined by the scrollbar placed at left side."
msgstr "颜色刻度可以通过左侧的滚动条来定义。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:45
msgid "The grays scale can be defined by a cursor click on the color scale."
msgstr "灰度刻度可以通过在颜色刻度上点击光标来定义。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:49
msgid ""
"For more information about HTML color code, refer to online resources as:"
msgstr "有关 HTML 颜色代码的更多信息，请参阅以下在线资源："

#: ../../source/users/annex/color.rst:51
msgid "https://htmlcolorcodes.com/"
msgstr "https://htmlcolorcodes.com/"
